  "date": "2013-07-21 17:59:09",
  "excerpt": "I have been involved in the Geek Bike Ride events from the inception in Brazil, and I have to say that the event yesterday in Shanghai was the hottest ever! Well, literally the hottest, because of the 100 degree weather (plus humidity), but also with a great turnout from the local GreenTea JUG. While we had a great set of riders from around the world including Michael H\u00fcttermann, Bert Ertman, and Arun Gupta, we also had a lot of local Shanghai coders come out for the ride.",
